<title>HONG KONG: BZW ups Cheung Kong call warrants.</title>
<headline>BZW ups Cheung Kong call warrants.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>BZW Warrants Ltd said on Tuesday it intended to increase the issue of American style call warrants on shares of Cheung Kong (Holdings) Ltd to 65 million warrants from 50 million warrants.</p>
<p>Terms remain unchanged.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$50.363    PREMIUM	 7.78 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$1.35	GEARING	 4.39X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  30.SEP.97    PAYDATE	 10.OCT.96</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG    MIN EXER LOT  10,000</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
